        "reference": "Isaiah 7:9",
        "book": "Isaiah",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Moreover the Lord spake again unto Ahaz, saying,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Isaiah 7:10",
        "book": "Isaiah",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Ask thee a sign of the Lord thy God; ask it either in the depth, or in the height above.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Isaiah 7:11",
        "book": "Isaiah",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "But Ahaz said, I will not ask, neither will I tempt the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 46,
            "end": 51,
            "text": "OR test, try. TG Test."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Isaiah 7:12",
        "book": "Isaiah",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "And he said, Hear ye now, O house of David; Is it a small thing for you to weary men, but will ye weary my God also?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 44,
            "end": 49
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Isaiah 7:13",
        "book": "Isaiah",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "Therefore the Lord himself shall give you a sign; Behold, a virgin shall conceive, and bear a son, and shall call his name Immanuel.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 44,
            "end": 48,
            "text": "TG Signs."
          },
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 56,
            "text": "Matt. 1:23."
          },
